  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given: **\n\n13 - [10 - {16 + 8 ÷ (k - 2)} + 2] = 20\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/624cbcebad2ad3bbb509aeb7ad3700b7aa118e9120876db5efbcc0048ac18064.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n13 - [10 - {16 + 8 ÷ (k - 2)} + 2] = 20\n\n⇒ - [10 - {16 + 8 ÷ (k - 2)} + 2] = 20 - 13\n\n⇒ - [10 - {16 + 8 × 1/(k - 2)} + 2] = 7\n\n⇒ - [10 - {16(k - 2) + 8}/(k - 2) + 2] = 7\n\n⇒ - [{10(k - 2)} - {16(k - 2) + 8} + {2(k - 2)}] = 7(k - 2)\n\n⇒ - [10k - 20 -16k + 32 - 8 + 2k - 4] = 7k - 14\n\n⇒ 4k = 7k - 14\n\n⇒ 3k = 14\n\n⇒ k = 14/3\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 14/3.**",
